ce","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/plandex-ai-plandex-df3a4c8ad2ce.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"plandex-ai/plandex","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:11:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_626760b532864ef8bf32f30dddb3ff40"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_176f67fd9004173cce1bc12057277e21cb88ea57d94dae65638c3310360400e0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"REPL commands include \\config, \\set-config, and \\set-auto, with `default` variants that modify configuration for new plans."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6a086cd409e0028981f53b19b913e05320e0c0744bad51cd51c77780f2642491"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A configuration system exposes settings such as auto-mode (none/basic/plus/semi/full, default semi), auto-apply (default false), auto-commit (default true), and can-exec, viewable via `plandex config` and modifiable via `plandex set-config`."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a4dab8ccca225a306afd16200f6182a7f6991eed0e647fa88149a3ad0adcc8be"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Many settings can be overridden per command with CLI flags (e.g. `plandex tell \"...\" --apply --auto-exec --debug`); these overrides apply only to that execution and don't change saved configuration."}],"claim_ids":["clm_176f67fd9004173cce1bc12057277e21cb88ea57d94dae65638c3310360400e0","clm_6a086cd409e0028981f53b19b913e05320e0c0744bad51cd51c77780f2642491","clm_a4dab8ccca225a306afd16200f6182a7f6991eed0e647fa88149a3ad0adcc8be"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:11:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_626760b532864ef8bf32f30dddb3ff40","id":"pg_7b1cdd7ccd68553a8494e9dec94093ee","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/plandex-ai-plandex-docs-docs-core-concepts-configuration-md-e2d772072e-e9dec94093ee.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_66dcc0040d1656edbfe02d932f4a4be9"],"title":"plandex-ai/plandex/docs/docs/core-concepts/configuration.md @ e2d772072efa","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:11:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_626760b532864ef8bf32f30dddb3ff40"}
